WEBVTT

00:01:59.996 --> 00:02:03.288
in exchange for a little
over 400,000 dollars

00:02:03.288 --> 00:02:06.079
and a 640-acre reservation.

00:02:07.163 --> 00:02:09.454
That works out
to about five cents an acre,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:14.246
which has to be one
of the worst land deals in US history.

00:02:14.954 --> 00:02:17.121
Or maybe the best,
depending on who you ask.

00:02:18.413 --> 00:02:22.204
This sort of thing happened
all over the US and Canada.

00:02:22.913 --> 00:02:25.371
The problem isn't just
that settlers showed up

00:02:25.413 --> 00:02:26.954
and took the land,

00:02:26.996 --> 00:02:28.996
it's how they've treated it ever since.

00:02:29.538 --> 00:02:31.329
That land we lost in Minnesota,